      "section_path": [
        "Employee Data Privacy Policy",
        "Retention schedule"
      ],
      "text": "A documented investigation hold pauses deletion for the specific affected records only. The record owner reviews holds every 90 days. Backups expire on a rolling 35-day schedule; a deletion request does not rewrite every historical backup immediately. Restored data must be reconciled against the deletion ledger before normal access resumes.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
